{title: Lead Me to the Cross}
{song_number: 24}
{language: en}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Bm]Saviour, I come, quiet my soul, [F#m/A]
[G]re[D]member [A]redemption's [Bm]hill,
[F#m/A]where Your blood was [G]spilled for my [D]ransom. [A]
[Em7]Everything I [Asus4]once held [A]dear,
I [Bm]count it [A]all as loss. [Gmaj7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[Bm]You were as I, tempted and tried, [F#m/A]
[G]hu[D]man. [A]The word became [Bm]flesh,
[F#m/A]bore my sin in [G]death. Now You're [D]risen. [A]
[Em7]Everything I [Asus4]once held [A]dear,
I [Bm]count it [A]all as loss. [Gmaj7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Gmaj7]Lead me to the [D]cross, [A]where Your love poured [Gmaj7]out.
[D]Bring me to my [A]knees, [Gmaj7]Lord, I lay me [D]down. [A]
[Gmaj7]Rid me of my[D]self, [A]I be[Em7]long to [G]You. [A]
Oh, lead me, [F#m]lead me to the [G]cross. [A]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[D]To Your [Gmaj7]heart, [A]to Your [D]heart.
[Gmaj7]Lead me to Your [D]heart, [Gmaj7]lead me to the [A]cross.
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
[Gmaj7]Lead me to the [D]cross, [A]where Your love poured [Gmaj7]out.
[D]Bring me to my [A]knees, [Gmaj7]Lord, I lay me [D]down. [A]
[Gmaj7]Rid me of my[D]self, [A]I be[Em7]long to [G]You. [A]
Oh, lead me, [F#m]lead me to the [G]cross. [A]
{end_of_chorus}
